  "idea": "Centralized team SOP hub that answers common questions using AI search",
  "text": "This self-serve documentation bot saves team leads hours of answering repetitive operational questions every week. Managers suffer severe mental fragmentation when junior staff interrupt deep work asking where templates live. Constant micro-interruptions destroy leadership productivity and delay high-value strategic deliverables across the organization. Integrating Guru with your internal wiki automatically detects questions in Slack channels and replies with accurate documentation snippets. This preserves leadership focus while keeping projects moving.",
